# Caddy in front of the synthesis server (server/README.md, step 4): HTTPS
# with a free certificate, compression, and nothing but the two endpoints.
# Replace the address with your server's name, e.g. 203-0-113-7.sslip.io.
SERVER_NAME {
	encode gzip
	@api path /api/version /api/synthesize
	handle @api {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8100
	}
	handle {
		respond 404
	}
}
